+## Local MATREX recording adapter (not an upstream release)
+
+The local source overlay adds a reconnectable filesystem mailbox to the ordinary desktop session, retaining the existing numerical engine and finalizer. Validation uses the bundled attributed MP4 through the actual native window, separate immutable takes, first submitted frame, ownership-fenced Stop, encoder completion and a nonrecorded gap. It does not establish physical camera timing or cross-platform execution. The MATREX integration records the exact source commit, patch hash, executable hash, request/take identity and closed-artifact hashes; its native probes and results are separate from the published v0.3.2 evidence above.
